    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d451">

                <pb facs="0555" n="481" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg481"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.7161/1</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Francis</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-18T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 18, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1999. Your 2233, January 14, 11 p.m., just received. Press reports show your
                    efforts successful. Department approves your course thoroughly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
